

# --- Before you commit (lines starting with # are ignored) ---------------
# [ ] docs/VERSION_HISTORY.md: new entry at the top, staged
#       heading:  ## v1.<n>.0 — `pending` — YYYY-MM-DD
#       Functional (what users/operators see), Technical (code, schema,
#       config), Deploy steps, Known limits
# [ ] Files listed under "Unreleased" moved into this entry if committed now
# [ ] New columns/tables: create_tables.sql AND a re-runnable ALTER script
# The hook fills in the previous entry's commit id automatically.
